---
import Benefits from './Benefits.astro'
---

<section
  id="hero-content"
  class="relative flex flex-col px-8 justify-evenly min-h-dvh"
  aria-label="KiraKana"
>
  <div
    class="container grid items-center w-full grid-cols-1 gap-16 mx-auto lg:grid-cols-2 "
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center space-y-4">
      <span
        class="block text-sm font-semibold font-japanese text-copper-100"
        aria-hidden="true"
      >
        キラカナ
      </span>
      <h1 class="font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-balance">
        Domina el
        <span class="text-ochre-200">Hiragana</span>
        y
        <span class="text-cyan-700">Katakana</span>
        con KiraKana
      </h1>
      <div class="max-w-xl md:text-xl text-pretty text-copper-100">
        <p>
          Descubre el fascinante mundo de los silabarios japoneses:
          <strong class="text-ochre-200">Hiragana</strong>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-japanese text-ochre-200"
            aria-label="hiragana en japonés"
          >
            (ひらがな)
          </span>
          y
          <strong class="text-cyan-700">Katakana</strong>
          <span
            class="text-sm font-japanese text-cyan-700"
            aria-label="katakana en japonés"
          >
            (カタカナ)
          </span>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Con nuestra plataforma practica el reconocimiento y la escucha,
          entrena tu mente para leer japonés con fluidez.
        </p>
      </div>
      <nav class="flex flex-wrap gap-4" aria-label="Acciones">
        <a
          href="/aprender"
          class="px-8 py-4 font-medium transition-all shadow-lg cursor-default sm:w-auto btn bg-linear-to-r from-ochre-200 to-ochre-100 text-mauve-50 hover:scale-95"
        >
          Comenzar a aprender
        </a>
        <a
          href="#como-funciona"
          class="px-8 py-4 transition-colors border-2 border-sun-100 sm:w-auto btn text-copper-100 hover:bg-amber-100"
        >
          Ver cómo funciona
        </a>
      </nav>
    </div>
    <figure
      class="flex items-center justify-center select-none md:justify-end"
      aria-label="Caracteres Hiragana y Katakana"
    >
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-3 p-8 text-center transition-transform duration-300 transform shadow-2xl gap-x-4 gap-y-2 rounded-2xl rotate-5 hover:rotate-0 bg-mauve-50"
      >
        <h2 class="col-span-3 font-semibold uppercase text-ochre-200">
          Hiragana
        </h2>
        <dl class="contents">
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-ochre-100">か</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ka
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-ochre-100">き</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ki
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-ochre-100">く</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ku
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-cyan-600">カ</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ka
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-cyan-600">キ</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ki
            </dd>
          </div>
          <div
            class="p-6 transition-transform bg-linen-200 rounded-xl hover:scale-105"
          >
            <dt class="mb-2 text-6xl font-japanese text-cyan-600">ク</dt>
            <dd class="text-sm tracking-widest uppercase text-copper-100">
              ku
            </dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <h2 class="col-span-3 font-semibold uppercase text-cyan-700">
          Katakana
        </h2>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
  <Benefits />
</section>
